tion:"The name provided as the producer.",producer_camera_definition:"The name provided as the photographer.",producer_edit_definition:"The name provided as the editor.",producer_ai_definition:"The name provided as the creator.",timestamp_definition:"The date and time the content was signed, as reported by the device or app.",timestamp_camera_definition:"The date and time the photo was taken, as reported by the device.",timestamp_edit_definition:"The date and time this edit was signed, as reported by the device or app.",timestamp_ai_definition:"The date and time the content was signed, as reported by the device or app.",signator_definition:"The entity that signed this record when the image was created.",signator_camera_definition:"The entity that signed this record when the photo was captured.",signator_edit_definition:"The entity that signed this record when the image was edited.",signator_ai_definition:"The entity that signed this record when the image was generated.",generator_definition:"The tool or software that created this content.",generator_camera_definition:"The camera model and software that captured this photo.",generator_edit_definition:"The software used to make this edit.",generator_ai_definition:"The tool or model that generated this content.",provenance_toggle:"View Image Origin",provenance_missing:"No provenance found",explainer_toggle:"What is this?",explainer_toggle_close:"Close",explainer_lede:"This image contains verifiable information to help you better understand and trust its origin.",explainer_section_1_title:"How is it verifiable",explainer_section_1_body:"Information about how, when, and where this image was created, and how it's changed since, is cryptographically secured at each step using [C2PA](https://c2pa.org), an emerging standard for making media origin traceable. This means the image or its history can't be edited or removed without leaving evidence.",explainer_section_2_title:"How to use this",explainer_section_2_body:"Select **View Image Origin** to see a summary of the file's history, step by step. Within each step you can see when the step occurred, what device or software was used for that step, and how it was cryptographically signed. You can see what the image looked like at that point in time in the **Image** tab. When available, you can also use the tabs to see where an image was captured in the **Map** tab, or what changes were made in the **Edits** tab.",explainer_footer:"Not all images carry this information, and not every step includes every detail. An incomplete record doesn't necessarily mean a file is fake, only that this information wasn't captured or made available.",status_trusted:"Trusted",status_valid:"Valid",status_invalid:"Invalid",status_unknown:"Unknown",status_validating:"Validating...",status_trusted_definition:"All C2PA data below is valid and trusted",status_valid_definition:"All C2PA data below is valid",status_invalid_definition:"We found some invalid C2PA data",status_unknown_definition:"We cannot find any C2PA provenance data to validate",type_camera:"Captured by Camera",type_ai:"AI Generated",type_edit:"Edits Made",type_camera_definition:"This image was captured by a camera",type_ai_definition:"This image was generated using AI",type_edit_definition:"This image was edited after it was created",tab_thumbnail:"Image",tab_location:"Map",tab_actions:"Edits",action_ai:"(Generative AI)",action_c2pa_created:"Created",action_c2pa_cropped:"Cropped",action_c2pa_deleted:"Deletion",action_c2pa_resized:"Resized",action_c2pa_orientation:"Orientation modified",action_c2pa_opened:"File opened",action_c2pa_placed:"Asset added",action_c2pa_removed:"Asset removed",action_c2pa_addedText:"Added text",action_c2pa_converted:"Converted file format",action_c2pa_edited:"Edited",action_c2pa_edited_metadata:"Metadata modified",action_c2pa_redacted:"Redacted",action_c2pa_watermarked:"Watermarked",action_c2pa_adjustedColor:"Color adjusted",action_c2pa_color_adjustments:"Color adjusted",